@k.words.egg.noun.1 k.words.sense word=egg pos=noun n=1 gloss="animal reproductive body consisting of an ovum or embryo together with nutritive and protective envelopes; especially the thin-shelled reproductive body laid by e.g. female birds" is_a=ovum kind_of=ovum kind_of=gamete kind_of="reproductive cell" kind_of=cell kind_of="living thing" kind_of=whole kind_of=object kind_of="physical entity" kind_of=entity core.source="wordnet 3.1"
