@k.words.egypt.noun.1 k.words.sense word=Egypt pos=noun n=1 gloss="a republic in northeastern Africa known as the United Arab Republic until 1971; site of an ancient civilization that flourished from 2600 to 30 BC" synonym="Arab Republic of Egypt" synonym="United Arab Republic" instance_of="African country" part_of="Middle East" part_of=Africa core.source="wordnet 3.1"
